561388410,"item_size":73303963,"metadata":{"identifier":"noise-arch_abstress","collection":["noise-arch","cassettetapes"],"date":"2009","description":"A digitized tape from the NOISE-ARCH Archives. Identifier: abstress","mediatype":"audio","scanner":"Internet Archive Python library 0.9.8","subject":"Cassette;Tape;Noise-Arch;Independent","title":"NOISE-ARCH: Abstress - Jazz's Bastard Chess","publicdate":"2015-12-03 00:01:10","uploader":"jscott@archive.org","addeddate":"2015-12-03 00:01:10","backup_location":"ia905506_3"},"reviews":[{"reviewbody":"This cassette is just incredible! Some weird smooth jazz stuff going on. Just started delving into this massive collection, and I am SO thankful it's available. So many good sounds! The Music From Philadelphia tape is also INCREDIBLE. Cheers to Noise Arch for all of this! Peace","reviewtitle":"Incredible!","reviewer":"OllieTurbitt","reviewdate":"2015-12-05 23:58:15","createdate":"2015-12-05 23:58:15","stars":"5"},{"reviewbody":"Three cuts of skronk with occasional rant. Like much of this collection, it sounds like something from the outer limits of music. Pieced together, these cassettes contain a sound that is sadly seldom heard. Cheers to NOISE-ARCH: the noise is music for weird heads. This one is a short stand-out.","reviewtitle":"Aaargh!","reviewer":"Mansion of Madness 89.3 FM KNON","reviewer_itemname":"@mansion_of_madness_89_3_fm_knon","reviewdate":"2019-06-24 15:00:05","createdate":"2019-06-24 15:00:05","stars":"4"}],"server":"ia801303.us.archive.org","uniq":1519233474,"workable_servers":["ia801303.us.archive.org","ia601303.us.archive.org"]}